1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:02,973
You look after everyone.

2
00:00:02,973 --> 00:00:04,060
All shift.

3
00:00:04,060 --> 00:00:05,345
Every shift.

4
00:00:05,345 --> 00:00:09,300
So, between tasks, who looks after you?

5
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:11,202
Racing thoughts.

6
00:00:11,202 --> 00:00:12,691
Tight shoulders.

7
00:00:12,691 --> 00:00:14,180
No time to stop.

8
00:00:14,780 --> 00:00:15,600
Breathe.

9
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:17,240
Serein has you.

10
00:00:17,840 --> 00:00:21,744
Tell it how you feel, and get the right two minute reset.

11
00:00:21,744 --> 00:00:25,580
Then breathe out, and let it leave, without forcing it.

12
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:42,420
Short practices, gentle journeys, small tools for real shifts.

13
00:00:44,400 --> 00:00:46,389
Free for everyone, always.

14
00:00:46,389 --> 00:00:48,760
And nothing is ever monitored.
